ublk: add UAPI for multi-size buffer pools

Add UBLK_F_BUF_RINGS and UBLK_F_PINNED_BUFS device flags,
UBLK_U_IO_ADD_BUF_POOL uring_cmd, and struct ublk_buf_pool_config
to support multi-size buffer pools in copy mode.

UBLK_F_BUF_RINGS enables kernel-managed buffer pools where the kernel
selects right-sized buffers at dispatch time based on blk_rq_bytes(rq).
UBLK_F_PINNED_BUFS optionally pins and vmaps the buffer memory for
memcpy-based copies without per-IO page table walks.

UBLK_F_BUF_RINGS is mutually exclusive with UBLK_F_NEED_GET_DATA.
UBLK_F_PINNED_BUFS requires UBLK_F_BUF_RINGS.

